"\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAround autumn in October 2026, here is the Hong Kong Big Flower Postcard.  \n\nA Pikachu wearing red sunglasses stands beside a travel suitcase.\n\nIt captures the exciting flutter of being just about to depart from the airport. In the front, a yellow Pikmin dressed in a burger outfit warmly greets you. It is a postcard you would definitely love to receive before heading off on a trip.\n\n\n\n\n"